      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Sec. 12-808. Fire extinguisher."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Each school bus shall be equipped with at least one dry chemical gauge type fire extinguisher mounted in the extinguisher manufacturer's automobile type bracket in a position readily accessible to the driver."
    },
    {
      "type": "source",
      "text": "(Source: P.A. 78-1244.)"
